<title>SINGAPORE: F J Benjamin to stop COACH distribution.</title>
<headline>F J Benjamin to stop COACH distribution.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Luxury fashion retailer F J Benjamin Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it would discontinue the distribution of products from COACH, a division of Sara Lee Corporation, from September 1.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement COACH wanted its leather goods to be distributed across Asia, but F J Benjamin disagreed with the strategy.</p>
<p>F J Benjamin, which has distributed COACH products in Singapore since July 1991, said the termination of the agreement was not expected to have an impact on its earnings per share for year ending June 30, 1998.</p>
</text>
